{"id":536,"slug":"antonio-gaudi","title":"Antonio Gaudí","year":1984,"country":"Japan","duration":72,"spine":425,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/536-antonio-gaudi","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/9fbb1fd3e4b0e01dba200e753955bb7a/NKIsmQqC7PGzqels7ynuEsT5dqK8Zs_large.jpg","description":"\nCatalan architect Antoni Gaudí (1852–1926) designed some of the world’s most astonishing buildings, interiors, and parks; Japanese director Hiroshi Teshigahara constructed some of the most aesthetically audacious films ever made. In Antonio Gaudí, their artistry melds in a unique, enthralling cinematic experience. Less a documentary than a visual poem, Teshigahara’s film takes viewers on a tour of Gaudí’s truly spectacular architecture, including his massive, still-unfinished master­piece, the Sagrada Família basilica in Barcelona. With camera work as bold and sensual as the curves of his subject’s organic structures, Teshigahara immortalizes Gaudí on film.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Hiroshi Teshigahara","slug":"hiroshi-teshigahara"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Isidre Puig Boada","role":"Interviewee","slug":"isidre-puig-boada"},{"actor":"Seiji Miyaguchi","role":"Boada's voice-over","slug":"seiji-miyaguchi"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Hiroshi Teshigahara","slug":"hiroshi-teshigahara"},{"role":"Producer","person":"Hiroshi Teshigahara","slug":"hiroshi-teshigahara"},{"role":"Editor","person":"Hiroshi Teshigahara","slug":"hiroshi-teshigahara"},{"role":"Supervisor","person":"Juan Bassegoda Nonell","slug":null},{"role":"Cinematography","person":"Junichi Segawa","slug":null},{"role":"Cinematography","person":"Yoshikazu Yanagida","slug":null},{"role":"Cinematography","person":"Ryu Segawa","slug":null},{"role":"Music and sound effects by","person":"Toru Takemitsu","slug":null},{"role":"Music and sound effects by","person":"Kurodo Mori","slug":null},{"role":"Music and sound effects by","person":"Shinji Hori","slug":null},{"role":"Sound